(4696005, 677441, 29474, '<td valign="top">An eternal picture. And after the challenge you can give it a normal title ... like "Fun in the Park"! Maybe a crop to the edge of the left tree would keep the eye in the frame: there is nothing happening in that part of the picture.</td>', 'An eternal picture. And after the challenge you can give it a normal title ... like "Fun in the Park"! Maybe a crop to the edge of the left tree would keep the eye in the frame: there is nothing happening in that part of the picture.', '2008-05-12 04:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4696007, 677533, 80831, '<td valign="top">Simply Gorgeous! ok changed my mind...best photo of the bunch...bumping you to a 10! Good Luck i expect this to be in the winners circle.</td>', 'Simply Gorgeous! ok changed my mind...best photo of the bunch...bumping you to a 10! Good Luck i expect this to be in the winners circle.', '2008-05-12 04:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4696015, 677717, 29474, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colouring. Fantastic composition with the clouds.</td>', 'Beautiful colouring. Fantastic composition with the clouds.', '2008-05-12 04:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4696016, 677702, 29474, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully different composition. Pity you couldn''t have cloned out the ''thing'' on the floor. A person walking through would have added a dynamic.</td>', 'Wonderfully different composition. Pity you couldn''t have cloned out the ''thing'' on the floor. A person walking through would have added a dynamic.', '2008-05-12 04:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4696019, 677817, 29474, '<td valign="top">At last a lightning shot that I like, and that works. And the colours are wonderful ... not the normal mauvey, pinky, bluey mess that we see with most lightning photographs.</td>', 'At last a lightning shot that I like, and that works. And the colours are wonderful ... not the normal mauvey, pinky, bluey mess that we see with most lightning photographs.', '2008-05-12 04:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4696020, 677777, 29474, '<td valign="top">Fantastic. I like the use of the colour. Well spotted with her hair. Maybe a bit of a crop of the light area at the top. It is very strong in relation to the rest of the image.</td>', 'Fantastic. I like the use of the colour. Well spotted with her hair. Maybe a bit of a crop of the light area at the top. It is very strong in relation to the rest of the image.', '2008-05-12 04:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4696021, 677533, 29474, '<td valign="top">I''m sure that I have seen this picture before. Beautiful colours. Well exposed.</td>', 'I''m sure that I have seen this picture before. Beautiful colours. Well exposed.', '2008-05-12 04:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4696022, 677856, 29474, '<td valign="top">The post-processing and choice of colour really make this work.<br/> <br/>He / she really looks a bit thin though.</td>', 'The post-processing and choice of colour really make this work. He / she really looks a bit thin though.', '2008-05-12 04:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4696023, 677974, 29474, '<td valign="top">It may be cliche, but it is well executed cliche. Colours work well together.</td>', 'It may be cliche, but it is well executed cliche. Colours work well together.', '2008-05-12 04:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4696025, 677722, 29474, '<td valign="top">Lovely use of the patterns of the clouds to enhance the depth of the building. One bicycle ... one person ... behind closed door ... can''t be much going on.</td>', 'Lovely use of the patterns of the clouds to enhance the depth of the building. One bicycle ... one person ... behind closed door ... can''t be much going on.', '2008-05-12 04:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4696033, 678001, 29474, '<td valign="top">Cute. Had to look twice to see that it is only one camel. Like the processing.</td>', 'Cute. Had to look twice to see that it is only one camel. Like the processing.', '2008-05-12 04:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4696036, 677327, 29474, '<td valign="top">Beautifully captured. Gives a wonderful sense of size. The colour is interesting though. Usually these are warmer orange tones, especially on the walls.</td>', 'Beautifully captured. Gives a wonderful sense of size. The colour is interesting though. Usually these are warmer orange tones, especially on the walls.', '2008-05-12 04:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4696039, 677916, 29474, '<td valign="top">Very simple. And the best of the flower pictures in the challenge. I don''t see an evidence of drops on the other flowers, although this may be the softness.</td>', 'Very simple. And the best of the flower pictures in the challenge. I don''t see an evidence of drops on the other flowers, although this may be the softness.', '2008-05-12 04:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4696043, 677824, 29474, '<td valign="top">Thingies make such wonderful photographs. Lovely.</td>', 'Thingies make such wonderful photographs. Lovely.', '2008-05-12 04:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4696044, 677727, 48228, '<td valign="top">Clever.....</td>', 'Clever.....', '2008-05-12 04:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4696046, 677682, 29474, '<td valign="top">Good to see something out of the box. The single eye is a bit disconcerting though. Good lighting. Good composition.</td>', 'Good to see something out of the box. The single eye is a bit disconcerting though. Good lighting. Good composition.', '2008-05-12 04:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4696047, 677838, 48228, '<td valign="top">DNMC.....but a good image though.<br/>Title doesn''t follow the rules for the ABC.</td>', 'DNMC.....but a good image though.Title doesn''t follow the rules for the ABC.', '2008-05-12 04:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4696049, 677496, 29474, '<td valign="top">And what is wrong with Chardonnay?<br/> <br/>Beautifully executed. Maybe a little more light on the glass and little less on the leaves.</td>', 'And what is wrong with Chardonnay? Beautifully executed. Maybe a little more light on the glass and little less on the leaves.', '2008-05-12 04:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4696052, 677952, 29474, '<td valign="top">This picture make one ask a hundred questions. Why is she sitting in a chair with, apparently, no clothes on? Is she peee''ed off? I like the composition and the offbeat pose.</td>', 'This picture make one ask a hundred questions. Why is she sitting in a chair with, apparently, no clothes on? Is she peee''ed off? I like the composition and the offbeat pose.', '2008-05-12 04:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4696053, 677703, 29474, '<td valign="top">I like the highly stylized presentation. Could be a stock photo. Or the poster for a comedy.</td>', 'I like the highly stylized presentation. Could be a stock photo. Or the poster for a comedy.', '2008-05-12 04:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4696054, 677733, 29474, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective. I wonder if a little more pop could be got from the colours.</td>', 'Simple and effective. I wonder if a little more pop could be got from the colours.', '2008-05-12 04:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4696055, 677122, 29474, '<td valign="top">Interesting that the ''harsh'' processing works so well with a subject as delicate as butterflies. Much better that the butterfly shots I took this week.</td>', 'Interesting that the ''harsh'' processing works so well with a subject as delicate as butterflies. Much better that the butterfly shots I took this week.', '2008-05-12 04:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4696056, 677657, 29474, '<td valign="top">Such good timing. And a title that you would hear in everyday English, unlike most of the others.</td>', 'Such good timing. And a title that you would hear in everyday English, unlike most of the others.', '2008-05-12 04:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4696058, 677554, 29474, '<td valign="top">Fantastic lighting. Not sure about the title though. Hippo and rock star are not two concepts that have come together for me before ... although a couple of rock stars may be approaching hippo size.</td>', 'Fantastic lighting. Not sure about the title though. Hippo and rock star are not two concepts that have come together for me before ... although a couple of rock stars may be approaching hippo size.', '2008-05-12 05:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4696059, 676366, 29474, '<td valign="top">Lost the last comment. Maintenence mode on the site kicked it.<br/> <br/>Love the expression, the isolation of the subject and the sense of movement. I wonder if the grass could have been ''less completely'' (can''t think of the word) desaturated.</td>', 'Lost the last comment. Maintenence mode on the site kicked it. Love the expression, the isolation of the subject and the sense of movement. I wonder if the grass could have been ''less completely'' (can''t think of the word) desaturated.', '2008-05-12 05:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4696060, 677413, 29474, '<td valign="top">Nice colours. Would it be asking too much for there to be a little more detail in the boat!</td>', 'Nice colours. Would it be asking too much for there to be a little more detail in the boat!', '2008-05-12 05:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4696061, 677853, 27133, '<td valign="top">Where''s the ''W''?</td>', 'Where''s the ''W''?', '2008-05-12 05:18:49.000000', NULL, 1);
