(4696384, 677185, 29474, '<td valign="top">Lesley Goodman. You really do have the ability to find the right moment to press the shutter button. Over and over you capture the essence of people. Compositions are interesting and of quirky.<br/> <br/>And all of that even if the technicals are not always perfect. Some overblown highlights on the left, a little soft and noisy, and a weird colour because of the acid processing.<br/> <br/>But it works. It works well. Over and over again.</td>', 'Lesley Goodman. You really do have the ability to find the right moment to press the shutter button. Over and over you capture the essence of people. Compositions are interesting and of quirky. And all of that even if the technicals are not always perfect. Some overblown highlights on the left, a little soft and noisy, and a weird colour because of the acid processing. But it works. It works well. Over and over again.', '2008-05-12 08:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
