(4698105, 678014, 90947, '<td valign="top">Well, what can I say.  This title certainly describes the scene and the title is consistent with the challenge.  Therefore, it seems this shot is right down the center of this challenge.  <br/> <br/>I think this shot could have used a shallower depth of field, or some judicious cropping to de-emphasize the background picnicers.  I also want to see the subjects more on the right of the image.  I have no idea why, I just do.   Moving the subjects to the right would have masked the background people and would have moved the baby away from the bright redish roof.<br/> <br/>All in all, I really like this photo.  Great job.  Thanks for sharing it with us.</td>', 'Well, what can I say.  This title certainly describes the scene and the title is consistent with the challenge.  Therefore, it seems this shot is right down the center of this challenge.   I think this shot could have used a shallower depth of field, or some judicious cropping to de-emphasize the background picnicers.  I also want to see the subjects more on the right of the image.  I have no idea why, I just do.   Moving the subjects to the right would have masked the background people and would have moved the baby away from the bright redish roof. All in all, I really like this photo.  Great job.  Thanks for sharing it with us.', '2008-05-12 21:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
