(4698126, 677703, 91783, '<td valign="top">i dont ike the expression on the womens face. i personally think that the man is a better model then the women.</td>', 'i dont ike the expression on the womens face. i personally think that the man is a better model then the women.', '2008-05-12 21:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698133, 677727, 90947, '<td valign="top">This took some work to reach to the challenge, but it was very successful. Congratulations in your thought process, execution of the subject creation, and the photographic excellence.  The yellow frame is a nice addition in my opinion. <br/> <br/>My only negative observation is the brightness of the intersection between the lemon rind and the black background.  It looks almost like it is glowing and it looks artificial.  Did you sharpen these areas or is this, perhaps, an artifact of adding a background.  I have no idea if this is what you did or not.  <br/> <br/>Nice shot.</td>', 'This took some work to reach to the challenge, but it was very successful. Congratulations in your thought process, execution of the subject creation, and the photographic excellence.  The yellow frame is a nice addition in my opinion.  My only negative observation is the brightness of the intersection between the lemon rind and the black background.  It looks almost like it is glowing and it looks artificial.  Did you sharpen these areas or is this, perhaps, an artifact of adding a background.  I have no idea if this is what you did or not.   Nice shot.', '2008-05-12 21:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698163, 677952, 90947, '<td valign="top">This photo keeps drawing me to it.  I am not sure just what it is, but I guess that is a characteristic of a good photograph.  <br/> <br/>I looked at the background color, and it is FF,FF,FF; about as white as one can get.  So, I guess this shot perfectly fits the Challenge.  Have I seen this model again?  I guess it doesn''t matter.  I like the shot.  <br/> <br/>My only negative comment is that black on the left side couch/chair lost its detail.  <br/> <br/>Great addition to this challenge.</td>', 'This photo keeps drawing me to it.  I am not sure just what it is, but I guess that is a characteristic of a good photograph.   I looked at the background color, and it is FF,FF,FF; about as white as one can get.  So, I guess this shot perfectly fits the Challenge.  Have I seen this model again?  I guess it doesn''t matter.  I like the shot.   My only negative comment is that black on the left side couch/chair lost its detail.   Great addition to this challenge.', '2008-05-12 22:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698164, 677703, 90947, '<td valign="top">This shot made me laugh, not only from the fantasy title (what man ever really gets control), which certainly meets the challenge, but the great look in the female models face.  The Man''s hand placement remind me a little of the "god touching man" from Michael Angelo''s Sistine Chapel.  I haven''t looked at others of your shots, but the lady is great.  I think it would be your good fortune to get to use her often.<br/> <br/>This is a crisp clean shot, well lit and posed. I think it must have been fun for you to create.</td>', 'This shot made me laugh, not only from the fantasy title (what man ever really gets control), which certainly meets the challenge, but the great look in the female models face.  The Man''s hand placement remind me a little of the "god touching man" from Michael Angelo''s Sistine Chapel.  I haven''t looked at others of your shots, but the lady is great.  I think it would be your good fortune to get to use her often. This is a crisp clean shot, well lit and posed. I think it must have been fun for you to create.', '2008-05-12 22:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698170, 677496, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cabernet is certainly VERY different from Chardonnay!  Nice setup; the greenish reflection is the wine doesn''t look too appealing, though.</td>', 'Cabernet is certainly VERY different from Chardonnay!  Nice setup; the greenish reflection is the wine doesn''t look too appealing, though.', '2008-05-12 22:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698171, 677824, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love the title ;-)  Nicely composed.</td>', 'Love the title ;-)  Nicely composed.', '2008-05-12 22:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698172, 677974, 48228, '<td valign="top">Stunning and love the soft pastel effect of this one......... <br/>One of my favorites for a ribbon..... <br/>Simple, delicate, and just beautiful, and also a favorite.....</td>', 'Stunning and love the soft pastel effect of this one......... One of my favorites for a ribbon..... Simple, delicate, and just beautiful, and also a favorite.....', '2008-05-12 22:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698176, 677712, 48228, '<td valign="top">WOW this is totally <b>AWESOME.....</b> <br/> <br/>A wonderful surprise, or is it a shock, as the tiger almost jumps right out of the picture into ones lap..... Thank goodness it doesn''t, as I would be in terrible strife..... Love the velvet feeling in the textures..... <br/>The eyes are amazing, especially the one on the left, as it is looking right at you..... Also love the use of the rule of thirds for this awesome composition.....</td>', 'WOW this is totally AWESOME.....  A wonderful surprise, or is it a shock, as the tiger almost jumps right out of the picture into ones lap..... Thank goodness it doesn''t, as I would be in terrible strife..... Love the velvet feeling in the textures..... The eyes are amazing, especially the one on the left, as it is looking right at you..... Also love the use of the rule of thirds for this awesome composition.....', '2008-05-12 22:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698183, 677579, 90947, '<td valign="top">Gruesome, but a part of nature.  excellent realization of the challenge.  Nice job.  Too bad the right antenna walked out of focus.</td>', 'Gruesome, but a part of nature.  excellent realization of the challenge.  Nice job.  Too bad the right antenna walked out of focus.', '2008-05-12 22:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698186, 677929, 65234, '<td valign="top">Not sure the title makes sense to me, but the image is lovely.  Nice light, DOF, detail.</td>', 'Not sure the title makes sense to me, but the image is lovely.  Nice light, DOF, detail.', '2008-05-12 22:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698188, 677957, 65234, '<td valign="top">Well, OK, then!  Quite colorful and brought me a smile.</td>', 'Well, OK, then!  Quite colorful and brought me a smile.', '2008-05-12 22:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698189, 677974, 61651, '<td valign="top">It may be cliche, but it sure is purty!  Nicely composed and glad you left it so soft.</td>', 'It may be cliche, but it sure is purty!  Nicely composed and glad you left it so soft.', '2008-05-12 22:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698194, 677898, 65234, '<td valign="top">Not quite getting the hustle and bustle of rush hour feel from this.  Maybe if the commuters had movement blur it might work better for me.</td>', 'Not quite getting the hustle and bustle of rush hour feel from this.  Maybe if the commuters had movement blur it might work better for me.', '2008-05-12 22:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698197, 677211, 65234, '<td valign="top">Not seeing quaking; she actually appears quite graceful and steady.  Cool shadows.</td>', 'Not seeing quaking; she actually appears quite graceful and steady.  Cool shadows.', '2008-05-12 22:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698198, 677816, 65234, '<td valign="top">I will have to take your word for it, not knowing Stan.</td>', 'I will have to take your word for it, not knowing Stan.', '2008-05-12 22:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698200, 677717, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks beautifully stormy in blue.</td>', 'Looks beautifully stormy in blue.', '2008-05-12 22:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698201, 677864, 65234, '<td valign="top">Can''t tell why the twist is surreal but I love the clock.</td>', 'Can''t tell why the twist is surreal but I love the clock.', '2008-05-12 22:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698204, 677646, 33769, '<td valign="top">really dream-like colors captured here; nicely done :) almost wonder where it is at because I used to live on a boat for a little while - rather a lovely sight to wake up to -sunrise/set on the water!! :) you really captured the essence of it in this image-- beatiful play of light/shadow! :)</td>', 'really dream-like colors captured here; nicely done :) almost wonder where it is at because I used to live on a boat for a little while - rather a lovely sight to wake up to -sunrise/set on the water!! :) you really captured the essence of it in this image-- beatiful play of light/shadow! :)', '2008-05-12 22:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698205, 677845, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice play on the flower name.</td>', 'Nice play on the flower name.', '2008-05-12 22:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698208, 677931, 33769, '<td valign="top">really cute! :) whatever tha tcircle is (a table?) is a little distracting but ignorning that - your subject is wonderfully toned, the textures of the chare are great and overall your B&amp;W scale is amazing :) Lovely relaxed expression on the childs face--high score, composition is nice, and now as i stare more at the image the half circle kind of gives my eyes a little play with shapes.... square vs circle....</td>', 'really cute! :) whatever tha tcircle is (a table?) is a little distracting but ignorning that - your subject is wonderfully toned, the textures of the chare are great and overall your B&W scale is amazing :) Lovely relaxed expression on the childs face--high score, composition is nice, and now as i stare more at the image the half circle kind of gives my eyes a little play with shapes.... square vs circle....', '2008-05-12 22:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698209, 677747, 33769, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, I love how the birds mouth is wide opened, and wings are spred out while the water splashes up behind it!  makes me think of the ducks locally frolicking in the water and havin ga blast swimming/flying over the water! they sure do seem to enjoy flying!!! :) beautiful color capture on the wings too! :)</td>', 'Nice capture, I love how the birds mouth is wide opened, and wings are spred out while the water splashes up behind it!  makes me think of the ducks locally frolicking in the water and havin ga blast swimming/flying over the water! they sure do seem to enjoy flying!!! :) beautiful color capture on the wings too! :)', '2008-05-12 22:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698212, 677970, 61651, '<td valign="top">Really like your title - as for the shot I''m wondering how it might have been to put this in portrait orientation with the heifer in the bottom third, so that we can see the long road stretching off beyond it.  That might (and I am just wondering here, I don''t really know) have accentuated the sense of impedance, by showing us more of the road/intended journey.</td>', 'Really like your title - as for the shot I''m wondering how it might have been to put this in portrait orientation with the heifer in the bottom third, so that we can see the long road stretching off beyond it.  That might (and I am just wondering here, I don''t really know) have accentuated the sense of impedance, by showing us more of the road/intended journey.', '2008-05-12 22:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698213, 677758, 90947, '<td valign="top">DNMC, sorry, neither did mine.  Keep up the good work.</td>', 'DNMC, sorry, neither did mine.  Keep up the good work.', '2008-05-12 22:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698215, 677856, 61651, '<td valign="top">Simple and direct - very nice tones.</td>', 'Simple and direct - very nice tones.', '2008-05-12 22:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698216, 677758, 65234, '<td valign="top">Not really sure how to react to this; was expecting words, not letters, and I''m not finding the letters all that appealing.</td>', 'Not really sure how to react to this; was expecting words, not letters, and I''m not finding the letters all that appealing.', '2008-05-12 22:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698219, 677545, 33769, '<td valign="top">hehe in the moment I pondered entering this competition I thought about entering an image similar to what you have and actually titling it the -same- thing! *I didnt'' enter, and i''m glad I didn''t -there is some -tough- competition in this challenge!!* --  this made me laugh because as they say ''great minds think alike'' and all... well- the composition is wonderfulthe tonal range is nice, and the movement you show here is very much like dancing! :)</td>', 'hehe in the moment I pondered entering this competition I thought about entering an image similar to what you have and actually titling it the -same- thing! *I didnt'' enter, and i''m glad I didn''t -there is some -tough- competition in this challenge!!* --  this made me laugh because as they say ''great minds think alike'' and all... well- the composition is wonderfulthe tonal range is nice, and the movement you show here is very much like dancing! :)', '2008-05-12 22:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698220, 677948, 65234, '<td valign="top">Don''t know if the dogs got a new person or the person got new dogs, but all 3 look happy.</td>', 'Don''t know if the dogs got a new person or the person got new dogs, but all 3 look happy.', '2008-05-12 22:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698223, 677768, 65234, '<td valign="top">Quaint?  Interesting use of the word.  Nice shot of the critter.</td>', 'Quaint?  Interesting use of the word.  Nice shot of the critter.', '2008-05-12 22:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698224, 677983, 33769, '<td valign="top">hehe- I almost entered this challenge-and was going to put in a title of a big white bird with its wings splayed out etc- (great minds think alike huh?) this is a -beatiful whimsical capture!  I love how the wings almost seem translucent! :) lovely image! (high score) :)</td>', 'hehe- I almost entered this challenge-and was going to put in a title of a big white bird with its wings splayed out etc- (great minds think alike huh?) this is a -beatiful whimsical capture!  I love how the wings almost seem translucent! :) lovely image! (high score) :)', '2008-05-12 22:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698225, 677919, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  I am somewhat confused  as how a vase tipping over can land on top of the tulip, but we will call it artistic license.</td>', 'Nice photo.  I am somewhat confused  as how a vase tipping over can land on top of the tulip, but we will call it artistic license.', '2008-05-12 22:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698226, 677822, 33769, '<td valign="top">true! and beautiful :) nice simple and elegant idea :) well executed = high score :)</td>', 'true! and beautiful :) nice simple and elegant idea :) well executed = high score :)', '2008-05-12 22:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698228, 677752, 65234, '<td valign="top">Oooh, pretty!  Love the purple in the reflections.  Composition feels a little awkward to me but the subject and DOF are quite nice.</td>', 'Oooh, pretty!  Love the purple in the reflections.  Composition feels a little awkward to me but the subject and DOF are quite nice.', '2008-05-12 22:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698230, 677919, 65234, '<td valign="top">You squooshed it!  Nice light.</td>', 'You squooshed it!  Nice light.', '2008-05-12 22:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698231, 677596, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  Title feels a little shoehorned, which on this challeges kinds of counts against you.</td>', 'Nice photo.  Title feels a little shoehorned, which on this challeges kinds of counts against you.', '2008-05-12 22:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698232, 677873, 65234, '<td valign="top">Kermit has green wheels.  That''s a lot of bright green!</td>', 'Kermit has green wheels.  That''s a lot of bright green!', '2008-05-12 22:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698234, 677747, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice light and great stop-action.  The duck''s expression does look joyful.</td>', 'Nice light and great stop-action.  The duck''s expression does look joyful.', '2008-05-12 22:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698236, 676781, 90947, '<td valign="top">This gave me a big smile.  Where does one go to get said "Special" Raspberry Jam.  ;-)  Nice idea.  <br/> <br/>Warning: the "Warning" is out of focus.  I might suggest a larger F stop to give you a bit more depth of field.  Next time, you might pick a new jar unless you are suggesting that Ohlson''s is just too good for a jar to stay new.  <br/> <br/>Nice job.</td>', 'This gave me a big smile.  Where does one go to get said "Special" Raspberry Jam.  ;-)  Nice idea.   Warning: the "Warning" is out of focus.  I might suggest a larger F stop to give you a bit more depth of field.  Next time, you might pick a new jar unless you are suggesting that Ohlson''s is just too good for a jar to stay new.   Nice job.', '2008-05-12 22:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698237, 677777, 65234, '<td valign="top">Quite intriguing; very nice job on the desat.  Looks like there could be a story here.</td>', 'Quite intriguing; very nice job on the desat.  Looks like there could be a story here.', '2008-05-12 22:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698238, 677174, 61651, '<td valign="top">Heh, heh - you are being punished I''m sure.  But not by me.  Clever title - colors in the horses especially seem a bit washed out, probably from that harsh midday glare, and could use maybe a touch more contrast.  But nice composition - I like that you chose to give the sky the bulk of the attention here.</td>', 'Heh, heh - you are being punished I''m sure.  But not by me.  Clever title - colors in the horses especially seem a bit washed out, probably from that harsh midday glare, and could use maybe a touch more contrast.  But nice composition - I like that you chose to give the sky the bulk of the attention here.', '2008-05-12 22:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698242, 677682, 65234, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool effect, especially with the makeup and glowing beverage.</td>', 'Pretty cool effect, especially with the makeup and glowing beverage.', '2008-05-12 22:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698243, 677833, 91496, '<td valign="top">I think hte concpet is good but the black on black does not work for me as I can not really see the fan aginst the dress.</td>', 'I think hte concpet is good but the black on black does not work for me as I can not really see the fan aginst the dress.', '2008-05-12 22:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698244, 677886, 65234, '<td valign="top">It''s not odd, it''s quite lovely.</td>', 'It''s not odd, it''s quite lovely.', '2008-05-12 22:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698246, 677409, 65234, '<td valign="top">Ewww!</td>', 'Ewww!', '2008-05-12 22:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698247, 677784, 61651, '<td valign="top">Not a usual composition for this type of shot - I like how it''s partially abstract.  Nice gradation of tone and detail.</td>', 'Not a usual composition for this type of shot - I like how it''s partially abstract.  Nice gradation of tone and detail.', '2008-05-12 22:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4698250, 677844, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  Obviously this looks better with a dry dog, but I am sure it took several tries to get the pose right.</td>', 'Nice capture.  Obviously this looks better with a dry dog, but I am sure it took several tries to get the pose right.', '2008-05-12 22:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
