(4699217, 677596, 90947, '<td valign="top">I understand this.  I get the question.  I hope that it is universally understood, but I doubt it.  I expect many would see this shot as an advertizement for high powered, large displacement, sporty cars.  This is a very powerful image and a powerful question, but I am not sure the image and question are obviously linked.  ... that is just one man''s opinion.  <br/> <br/>I really like how you caught the reflection of the headlights and the contrast between the sky and car in both color and intensity is great.  <br/> <br/>I really like this image.</td>', 'I understand this.  I get the question.  I hope that it is universally understood, but I doubt it.  I expect many would see this shot as an advertizement for high powered, large displacement, sporty cars.  This is a very powerful image and a powerful question, but I am not sure the image and question are obviously linked.  ... that is just one man''s opinion.   I really like how you caught the reflection of the headlights and the contrast between the sky and car in both color and intensity is great.   I really like this image.', '2008-05-13 11:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
