(4699435, 677703, 58457, '<td valign="top">I like this setup and clever idea.  I think I would want maybe a tighter crop.... or perhaps if this were in an actual living room instead of the studio--I''m not sure...  its right there as far as the idea goes, but to take it further into the really high score it just needs something else. 7.</td>', 'I like this setup and clever idea.  I think I would want maybe a tighter crop.... or perhaps if this were in an actual living room instead of the studio--I''m not sure...  its right there as far as the idea goes, but to take it further into the really high score it just needs something else. 7.', '2008-05-13 13:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4699443, 677822, 41675, '<td valign="top">Title works. I like the colors and lighting on the rings. My eyes keep getting pulled down to the blurred flower in the lower left however - bit of a distraction for me. Otherwise a good entry.</td>', 'Title works. I like the colors and lighting on the rings. My eyes keep getting pulled down to the blurred flower in the lower left however - bit of a distraction for me. Otherwise a good entry.', '2008-05-13 14:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4699444, 678015, 41675, '<td valign="top">Good title for the image. Love the black background so the colors of the "weed" pop. Nice macro. Best of luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Good title for the image. Love the black background so the colors of the "weed" pop. Nice macro. Best of luck in the challenge.', '2008-05-13 14:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4699445, 677843, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Good lighting. I wish he was looking more at the camera than off to the side.</td>', 'Nice shot. Good lighting. I wish he was looking more at the camera than off to the side.', '2008-05-13 14:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4699446, 678003, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice macro. Good colors. Title is okay, but not discounting points as you have the "bcd"</td>', 'Nice macro. Good colors. Title is okay, but not discounting points as you have the "bcd"', '2008-05-13 14:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4699447, 677441, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice fun park scene. I do wonder what the color version looks like though. I like the darkness of the trees.</td>', 'Nice fun park scene. I do wonder what the color version looks like though. I like the darkness of the trees.', '2008-05-13 14:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4699451, 677927, 41675, '<td valign="top">Lol - it took me a minute to figure this out - clever. I like the angle. The colors appear a bit muted, but thats me.</td>', 'Lol - it took me a minute to figure this out - clever. I like the angle. The colors appear a bit muted, but thats me.', '2008-05-13 14:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4699453, 677995, 41675, '<td valign="top">I really like how the blurred foliage of the background contrasts with the vulture and tree. Good composition and title is appropriate for challenge. Good luck.</td>', 'I really like how the blurred foliage of the background contrasts with the vulture and tree. Good composition and title is appropriate for challenge. Good luck.', '2008-05-13 14:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4699456, 677908, 41675, '<td valign="top">Lol - fun photo. Love the blurred background - sets the bird off nicely. Great clarity and sharpness on the feathers. The border is a bit thick for my personal taste, but otherwise one of my favorites in this challenge so far. Good luck!</td>', 'Lol - fun photo. Love the blurred background - sets the bird off nicely. Great clarity and sharpness on the feathers. The border is a bit thick for my personal taste, but otherwise one of my favorites in this challenge so far. Good luck!', '2008-05-13 14:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4699458, 677885, 41675, '<td valign="top">Aww man, my stomach was already rumbling and then your shot pops up. Lol. I like the chocolate around the candy bar and your concept. The lighting is a little harsh, especially on the to of the miniature causing it to look grainy. Hmmm, gotta grab a snack now. :-)</td>', 'Aww man, my stomach was already rumbling and then your shot pops up. Lol. I like the chocolate around the candy bar and your concept. The lighting is a little harsh, especially on the to of the miniature causing it to look grainy. Hmmm, gotta grab a snack now. :-)', '2008-05-13 14:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4699459, 677409, 41675, '<td valign="top">Lol and ewww! I''m sure your getting many interesting comments off of this one. Weird and gross, but funny at the same time. I like the color contrast of background and gum. Good lighting.</td>', 'Lol and ewww! I''m sure your getting many interesting comments off of this one. Weird and gross, but funny at the same time. I like the color contrast of background and gum. Good lighting.', '2008-05-13 14:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4699460, 677655, 41675, '<td valign="top">Good processing on this image. I really like the softness - it has a painterly quality about it. Nice lighting as well. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Good processing on this image. I really like the softness - it has a painterly quality about it. Nice lighting as well. Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-05-13 14:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4699461, 677730, 41675, '<td valign="top">Awww, very cute. I like the texture of their skin and the composition of your image. For me, I wish the lighting were different, maybe brighter to create some better shadows.</td>', 'Awww, very cute. I like the texture of their skin and the composition of your image. For me, I wish the lighting were different, maybe brighter to create some better shadows.', '2008-05-13 14:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4699462, 677747, 41675, '<td valign="top">:-) Good title and image. I like the water coming off the legs. Good color and lighting too.</td>', ':-) Good title and image. I like the water coming off the legs. Good color and lighting too.', '2008-05-13 14:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4699463, 677228, 41675, '<td valign="top">Wow! That''s a vibrant bluebird! Maybe a tad to saturated, but nice composition. I also wish there was a bit more of the background, that it wasn''t so blurred out, but that''s me.</td>', 'Wow! That''s a vibrant bluebird! Maybe a tad to saturated, but nice composition. I also wish there was a bit more of the background, that it wasn''t so blurred out, but that''s me.', '2008-05-13 14:20:42.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4699464, 677573, 41675, '<td valign="top">Good zoo shot. Maybe a bit over sharpened, but nice off-center composition.</td>', 'Good zoo shot. Maybe a bit over sharpened, but nice off-center composition.', '2008-05-13 14:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4699466, 677862, 41675, '<td valign="top">Great title for your photo. I wish there was a bit more sun/light. Looks like it was an overcast day. Good nature capture.</td>', 'Great title for your photo. I wish there was a bit more sun/light. Looks like it was an overcast day. Good nature capture.', '2008-05-13 14:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4699467, 677913, 41675, '<td valign="top">The processing of the depot really stands out to me. The sky looks a bit funny in comparison though. Also, I wonder how this would look with that little bit of tree on the right cropped out completely.</td>', 'The processing of the depot really stands out to me. The sky looks a bit funny in comparison though. Also, I wonder how this would look with that little bit of tree on the right cropped out completely.', '2008-05-13 14:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4699469, 677792, 41675, '<td valign="top">The zebra fur seems to have an odd reddish cast to it. I wish it was just the one zebra as the other takes my attention away.</td>', 'The zebra fur seems to have an odd reddish cast to it. I wish it was just the one zebra as the other takes my attention away.', '2008-05-13 14:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4699471, 677327, 41675, '<td valign="top">Nice interior church photo. I wonder if there was anything that could be done to tone down the greensih cast or not. I like the leading lines to the alter.</td>', 'Nice interior church photo. I wonder if there was anything that could be done to tone down the greensih cast or not. I like the leading lines to the alter.', '2008-05-13 14:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4699474, 677997, 41675, '<td valign="top">When I look at your photo my eyes stay pretty much in the middle and there isn''t anything there but the floor and I lose interest. My favorite part of your image is the reflection on the under belly of the plane.</td>', 'When I look at your photo my eyes stay pretty much in the middle and there isn''t anything there but the floor and I lose interest. My favorite part of your image is the reflection on the under belly of the plane.', '2008-05-13 14:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4699475, 677856, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like it. Seems kinds of shy. Good tonal values and composition.</td>', 'I like it. Seems kinds of shy. Good tonal values and composition.', '2008-05-13 14:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4699476, 677957, 41675, '<td valign="top">Lol - can''t help but smile when this popped up on my screen. Fun photo! So bright and whimsical. Good luck in the challenge. 8</td>', 'Lol - can''t help but smile when this popped up on my screen. Fun photo! So bright and whimsical. Good luck in the challenge. 8', '2008-05-13 14:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4699479, 677174, 41675, '<td valign="top">Well, you pretty much coverd 25% of the alphabet with that title. Lol. As for your image, I like it. Good angle and I like the brightness of the sky and the green of the rolling hills.</td>', 'Well, you pretty much coverd 25% of the alphabet with that title. Lol. As for your image, I like it. Good angle and I like the brightness of the sky and the green of the rolling hills.', '2008-05-13 14:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4699495, 676286, 41675, '<td valign="top">What a sweet, colorful image! I love it. From her pink dress to the blooming flowers and rock path. In my top ten! Good luck.</td>', 'What a sweet, colorful image! I love it. From her pink dress to the blooming flowers and rock path. In my top ten! Good luck.', '2008-05-13 14:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4699496, 677533, 41675, '<td valign="top">Wow! great sunset - even if it is enhanced. Overall a nice landscape. Well done and good luck.</td>', 'Wow! great sunset - even if it is enhanced. Overall a nice landscape. Well done and good luck.', '2008-05-13 14:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4699505, 677876, 90947, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  It looks like it could pull up next to the "Quaint Rail Station" in this challenge.  They have similar very stormy weather color balance and cloud formations.</td>', 'Great shot.  It looks like it could pull up next to the "Quaint Rail Station" in this challenge.  They have similar very stormy weather color balance and cloud formations.', '2008-05-13 14:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4699506, 677404, 90947, '<td valign="top">Perfect title for this shot and for the challenge.  Nice focus on the flowers and the background is nicely out of focus.  I think I might have cropped out some of the background and made it a vertical image, although you would have to have some of the background to support the "tree" in the title.  <br/> <br/>Great shot.</td>', 'Perfect title for this shot and for the challenge.  Nice focus on the flowers and the background is nicely out of focus.  I think I might have cropped out some of the background and made it a vertical image, although you would have to have some of the background to support the "tree" in the title.   Great shot.', '2008-05-13 14:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4699508, 677907, 90947, '<td valign="top">This ole bovine make me laugh... what a look on the face.  Great!  Nice exposure, but I think I might have tried to shrink the dept of field a bit more.  As you have already cut off the tips of the horns, perhaps a further crop, eliminating more of the white sky, and a bit of the extra bovine in the backgound, would spruce up the shot.<br/> <br/>Very nice.</td>', 'This ole bovine make me laugh... what a look on the face.  Great!  Nice exposure, but I think I might have tried to shrink the dept of field a bit more.  As you have already cut off the tips of the horns, perhaps a further crop, eliminating more of the white sky, and a bit of the extra bovine in the backgound, would spruce up the shot. Very nice.', '2008-05-13 14:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
