(4705672, 677560, 12661, '<td valign="top">There is a lot of depth in the expression of the model. I can''t exactly put my finger on it, which kind of works as it leaves a bit of mystery into what she was thinking. As far as lighting and composition, I personally think you missed the mark. If I were taking this, I would have avoided the shadow across the face and the white area on the left. Also, I would have placed the model off center and up further to include more of the shoulders.</td>', 'There is a lot of depth in the expression of the model. I can''t exactly put my finger on it, which kind of works as it leaves a bit of mystery into what she was thinking. As far as lighting and composition, I personally think you missed the mark. If I were taking this, I would have avoided the shadow across the face and the white area on the left. Also, I would have placed the model off center and up further to include more of the shoulders.', '2008-05-16 00:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
