(4705686, 677702, 10818, '<td valign="top">Great perspective.  The lighting makes for a great contrast in B @ W.</td>', 'Great perspective.  The lighting makes for a great contrast in B @ W.', '2008-05-16 00:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4705692, 678014, 12661, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed, nice use of DOF to isolate the subject, and nice use of soft focus. On the negative side, the brightness of the orange roof is distracting and I personally would have liked to see eyes as they are the gateway to emotion.</td>', 'Beautifully composed, nice use of DOF to isolate the subject, and nice use of soft focus. On the negative side, the brightness of the orange roof is distracting and I personally would have liked to see eyes as they are the gateway to emotion.', '2008-05-16 00:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4705694, 677655, 10818, '<td valign="top">This is a perfect shot for soft focus, but pretty for any contest.<br/>I may have cropped out the sky, it seems a bit blown out.  But then takes out the tree that gives the shot a good balance.  Tough call, good luck.</td>', 'This is a perfect shot for soft focus, but pretty for any contest.I may have cropped out the sky, it seems a bit blown out.  But then takes out the tree that gives the shot a good balance.  Tough call, good luck.', '2008-05-16 00:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4705699, 677733, 12661, '<td valign="top">I like the keyhole technique used here. I''m sitting here with index cards recropping your image on screen to see how it would look if you took more of the foreground off. I think I would prefer it if the crop was tighter leaving the background as the major element and the foreground as an aside.</td>', 'I like the keyhole technique used here. I''m sitting here with index cards recropping your image on screen to see how it would look if you took more of the foreground off. I think I would prefer it if the crop was tighter leaving the background as the major element and the foreground as an aside.', '2008-05-16 00:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4705703, 678005, 12661, '<td valign="top">Well I guess there is no doubt that this was taken during the challenge time period. I like the way the top of the watch fades to black. Also, nice job in avoiding overexposed glares. For this subject, I think a centered composition may have also worked well.</td>', 'Well I guess there is no doubt that this was taken during the challenge time period. I like the way the top of the watch fades to black. Also, nice job in avoiding overexposed glares. For this subject, I think a centered composition may have also worked well.', '2008-05-16 00:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4705723, 677581, 41675, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, I see where your coming from for this challenge - taking a photo of consecutive alphabet letters whereas the challenge was to use a consecutive three word title. For me, there are a couple of distracting elements from your main focus, but I do like the bright colors and daylight.</td>', 'Hmmm, I see where your coming from for this challenge - taking a photo of consecutive alphabet letters whereas the challenge was to use a consecutive three word title. For me, there are a couple of distracting elements from your main focus, but I do like the bright colors and daylight.', '2008-05-16 00:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4705724, 677727, 41675, '<td valign="top">Kind of a neat image. Creative. Title fits the challenge. Good lighting. Bit of mottling with the background, but overall a nice photo.</td>', 'Kind of a neat image. Creative. Title fits the challenge. Good lighting. Bit of mottling with the background, but overall a nice photo.', '2008-05-16 00:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4705742, 677873, 41675, '<td valign="top">:-) Your photo made me smile. I like Kermit''s expression. The background isn''t the best with the cars, parking lot and people, but fun to look at.</td>', ':-) Your photo made me smile. I like Kermit''s expression. The background isn''t the best with the cars, parking lot and people, but fun to look at.', '2008-05-16 01:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4705744, 677918, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like all the pollen fuzzies on the bee. Good insect macro. Your image makes bees look almost cute.</td>', 'I like all the pollen fuzzies on the bee. Good insect macro. Your image makes bees look almost cute.', '2008-05-16 01:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4705746, 677404, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, at first glance, your image is visually deceptive. My eyes saw the dark tree on the right and followed the outstretched branch, leading me to think the flowers were from that branch. As my eyes adjusted to your image I saw the flowers are hanging by a different branch and in a way seem to be kind of...."floating" for lack of a more technical word. (I''m not much of a technical person, so you''ll have to bear with my first impression comment).</td>', 'For me, at first glance, your image is visually deceptive. My eyes saw the dark tree on the right and followed the outstretched branch, leading me to think the flowers were from that branch. As my eyes adjusted to your image I saw the flowers are hanging by a different branch and in a way seem to be kind of...."floating" for lack of a more technical word. (I''m not much of a technical person, so you''ll have to bear with my first impression comment).', '2008-05-16 01:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4705749, 677838, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, I wish you had just gone with the "XYZ" for your title to keep more in line with the challenge description. I like the tonal values and lighting. This is one of those photos that people think about taking, but that you actually did.</td>', 'For me, I wish you had just gone with the "XYZ" for your title to keep more in line with the challenge description. I like the tonal values and lighting. This is one of those photos that people think about taking, but that you actually did.', '2008-05-16 01:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4705755, 677903, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the tight close up and the eyes. For me, it seems maybe a bit over processed with the light, but overall a good image and the title fits the challenge.</td>', 'I like the tight close up and the eyes. For me, it seems maybe a bit over processed with the light, but overall a good image and the title fits the challenge.', '2008-05-16 01:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4705758, 677992, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, the box seems kind of a random element and doesn''t quite fit or another element is needed. I do like her pose and the contrasting color of her clothes to the white, and the title fits the challenge description.</td>', 'For me, the box seems kind of a random element and doesn''t quite fit or another element is needed. I do like her pose and the contrasting color of her clothes to the white, and the title fits the challenge description.', '2008-05-16 01:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4705769, 677963, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like your composition, colors and DOF. For me, I feel like the flower is speaking out to the softly colored blurred background...I like that aspect.</td>', 'I like your composition, colors and DOF. For me, I feel like the flower is speaking out to the softly colored blurred background...I like that aspect.', '2008-05-16 01:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
