(4708527, 677914, 85545, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and composition. His skin looks a little red to me, but it also looks as if it may have been intentional for the photo but it the first thing I noticed.</td>', 'I like the idea and composition. His skin looks a little red to me, but it also looks as if it may have been intentional for the photo but it the first thing I noticed.', '2008-05-17 18:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
