(4708617, 677902, 60698, '<td valign="top">That''s a weird little bike... he must be comfortable with his manhood. Yep, he reaaaaly looks like an Alabamian! Plaid shirt, baseball cap, denim, ciggy...I can almost hear the drawl! :) Wonderful photo with great detail and interesting subject matter.</td>', 'That''s a weird little bike... he must be comfortable with his manhood. Yep, he reaaaaly looks like an Alabamian! Plaid shirt, baseball cap, denim, ciggy...I can almost hear the drawl! :) Wonderful photo with great detail and interesting subject matter.', '2008-05-17 19:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4708620, 677847, 60698, '<td valign="top">Peaceful and beautiful! Colors are wonderful!</td>', 'Peaceful and beautiful! Colors are wonderful!', '2008-05-17 19:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
