(4709089, 677943, 90663, '<td valign="top">Can really get a feel for the emotion from this picture, I also like the depth of field, that the girl''s hand is slightly blurred</td>', 'Can really get a feel for the emotion from this picture, I also like the depth of field, that the girl''s hand is slightly blurred', '2008-05-18 02:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
