(4709096, 677600, 90663, '<td valign="top">Wow I don''t think I''ve ever seen eyes that sort of aqua blue-green in a cat before!  The light on his back is a bit strong for my taste but nice fill light in his face, well-captured moment</td>', 'Wow I don''t think I''ve ever seen eyes that sort of aqua blue-green in a cat before!  The light on his back is a bit strong for my taste but nice fill light in his face, well-captured moment', '2008-05-18 03:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
