(4709101, 676747, 90663, '<td valign="top">I''m interested in finding out what this is actually...looks like a sculpture of an Indian headdress.  I think I might have exposed your main subject a little more even if it blew out the clouds a bit</td>', 'I''m interested in finding out what this is actually...looks like a sculpture of an Indian headdress.  I think I might have exposed your main subject a little more even if it blew out the clouds a bit', '2008-05-18 03:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
