(4709132, 678006, 32872, '<td valign="top">Ahh this is so pretty and wild!  Your detail and lighting are perfect..your image is perfect! My only 10 so far!  (how did you get this angle...wow?!?)</td>', 'Ahh this is so pretty and wild!  Your detail and lighting are perfect..your image is perfect! My only 10 so far!  (how did you get this angle...wow?!?)', '2008-05-18 03:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
