(4710930, 677441, 63152, '<td valign="top">AP - yep it''s taken in the same park as the ''early morning light'' one. This time around it''s evening and I''m in a different part of the park and facing the other direction.<br/> <br/>I love taking pictures into the sun and handling the shadows that you get then.<br/> <br/>You are absolutely correct as well with the man walking to the right of the bench, I had a shot where he was clear but then I lost the nice shapes in the group on the left (the girl standing up had sat down). This sort of unpredictability is what makes these types of shots fun to take (and see usually) but sometimes it prevents you from getting everything right.<br/> <br/>I''m very happy with the shot though and thanks everyone for their comments :)</td>', 'AP - yep it''s taken in the same park as the ''early morning light'' one. This time around it''s evening and I''m in a different part of the park and facing the other direction. I love taking pictures into the sun and handling the shadows that you get then. You are absolutely correct as well with the man walking to the right of the bench, I had a shot where he was clear but then I lost the nice shapes in the group on the left (the girl standing up had sat down). This sort of unpredictability is what makes these types of shots fun to take (and see usually) but sometimes it prevents you from getting everything right. I''m very happy with the shot though and thanks everyone for their comments :)', '2008-05-19 09:09:23.000000', NULL, 0),
