(4711448, 677174, 92383, '<td valign="top">Wow! I am learning from you... I see that many of the people here, people who have been here much longer than I have, take the tiny things very, very serious.  I can see that the title was just in fun and it more than met the challenge.  DNMC is really a prudish comment here.  Just my opinion though.  I will be very careful to stay firmly within the box at this site.<br/> <br/>I didn''t catch on first view, maybe cause I am new, but the horses <i>are</i> pretty washed out.  <br/> <br/>Jay</td>', 'Wow! I am learning from you... I see that many of the people here, people who have been here much longer than I have, take the tiny things very, very serious.  I can see that the title was just in fun and it more than met the challenge.  DNMC is really a prudish comment here.  Just my opinion though.  I will be very careful to stay firmly within the box at this site. I didn''t catch on first view, maybe cause I am new, but the horses are pretty washed out.   Jay', '2008-05-19 14:21:24.000000', NULL, 0),
