(4711799, 677657, 67697, '<td valign="top">I thought this was an excellent shot.  I loved the angle and the action captured.  I appreciate that you included your set-up info.  I will probably not be setting up cameras in this fashion but it helps give me ideas so I can shoot my own kids as baseball season approaches.  Amazing photo.</td>', 'I thought this was an excellent shot.  I loved the angle and the action captured.  I appreciate that you included your set-up info.  I will probably not be setting up cameras in this fashion but it helps give me ideas so I can shoot my own kids as baseball season approaches.  Amazing photo.', '2008-05-19 17:21:01.000000', NULL, 0),
