(4711836, 677674, 48245, '<td valign="top">I liked his castle Linderhof (which is more like a mansion).<br/> <br/>Also, did you ever check out the Texas <a href="//www.falkensteincastle.com/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Falkenstein castle</a> during your stay in San Antonio? It is based off of a Ludwig design for a castle he never built.<br/> <br/>p.s. Nice picture.</td>', 'I liked his castle Linderhof (which is more like a mansion). Also, did you ever check out the Texas Falkenstein castle during your stay in San Antonio? It is based off of a Ludwig design for a castle he never built. p.s. Nice picture.', '2008-05-19 17:49:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4711851, 677674, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is breathtakingly stunning.  Postcard, perhaps, but there is a good reason for that.  I love that a bridge was built over the gorge, makes you wonder if it was specifically built for the view of the castle.</td>', 'This is breathtakingly stunning.  Postcard, perhaps, but there is a good reason for that.  I love that a bridge was built over the gorge, makes you wonder if it was specifically built for the view of the castle.', '2008-05-19 18:02:24.000000', NULL, 0),
