(4711886, 677817, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is really an amazing shot and I love your enthusiasm for it as well!  Don''t ya just love getting THE shot?   I particularly like the brightness at the origin of the bolt and then the gradient darkness in the sky and the nice toning of the beach and water.  The pier adds a lot to this shot as well.  Nature sure gave you a shot to remember!</td>', 'This is really an amazing shot and I love your enthusiasm for it as well!  Don''t ya just love getting THE shot?   I particularly like the brightness at the origin of the bolt and then the gradient darkness in the sky and the nice toning of the beach and water.  The pier adds a lot to this shot as well.  Nature sure gave you a shot to remember!', '2008-05-19 18:28:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4711934, 677829, 67145, '<td valign="top">great shot judy ... very different and love your process .. <br/>ken came up with an interesting take on this with a bit''v help from the heads .. pretty funny actually . :)</td>', 'great shot judy ... very different and love your process .. ken came up with an interesting take on this with a bit''v help from the heads .. pretty funny actually . :)', '2008-05-19 19:04:25.000000', NULL, 0),
