(4713191, 676366, 52549, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning capture, the colours, and clarity are fantastic. Also, you chose (IMO) the most difficult letters of the alphabet for your title. Bravo and congratulations on top ten, Bob.</td>', 'This is a stunning capture, the colours, and clarity are fantastic. Also, you chose (IMO) the most difficult letters of the alphabet for your title. Bravo and congratulations on top ten, Bob.', '2008-05-20 15:30:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4713203, 677727, 40679, '<td valign="top">aaaah that is awesome!<br/> <br/>a while ago I digitally manipulated a lemon &amp; kiwi together for my study... It''s SO cool that you did it "live" and for real!<br/> <br/>Congrats on the top 10 placing :D<br/> <br/>If you''d like to see it, here''s my manipulated version ;) <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=345817" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40000-44999/40679/120/345817.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40000-44999/40679/120/345817.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/40000-44999/40679/120/345817.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/></td>', 'aaaah that is awesome! a while ago I digitally manipulated a lemon & kiwi together for my study... It''s SO cool that you did it "live" and for real! Congrats on the top 10 placing :D If you''d like to see it, here''s my manipulated version ;)   ', '2008-05-20 15:56:04.000000', NULL, 0),
