(4713403, 677817, 90269, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!  I can picture "the legend"  taking this shot with your dad - sounds like you were both jumping up and down.  It''s an awesome (can''t help using it again) shot!  You deserve the blue!</td>', 'Congratulations!  I can picture "the legend"  taking this shot with your dad - sounds like you were both jumping up and down.  It''s an awesome (can''t help using it again) shot!  You deserve the blue!', '2008-05-20 18:50:06.000000', NULL, 0),
