(4713855, 677717, 67145, '<td valign="top">i''ve just looked at your last 10 entries in challenges .. if mojo is so easily lost and then reclaimed i''m wondering if you''d give me a bit of yours .. you have plenty !! <br/>another amazing photograph .. i know i commented before, but it''s pretty excellent .. nothing like making a point i reckon .. gotta go .. :)</td>', 'i''ve just looked at your last 10 entries in challenges .. if mojo is so easily lost and then reclaimed i''m wondering if you''d give me a bit of yours .. you have plenty !! another amazing photograph .. i know i commented before, but it''s pretty excellent .. nothing like making a point i reckon .. gotta go .. :)', '2008-05-21 00:49:57.000000', NULL, 0),
