(4714601, 677988, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657243" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657243.jpg"/></a> mmmm, nothing better than a rail fence receding in the fog.  the deep tones really make this one.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-05-21 09:17:07.</i></td>', ' mmmm, nothing better than a rail fence receding in the fog.  the deep tones really make this one.', '2008-05-21 10:16:16.000000', '2008-05-21 10:17:07.000000', 0),
