(4714603, 677829, 53572, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=657241" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657241.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657241.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/53572/120/657241.jpg"/></a> o, man, this is good.  the simplicity, the contrast, the motion, the little bits of stuff in the air.  this makes me happy.<br/> <br/></td>', ' o, man, this is good.  the simplicity, the contrast, the motion, the little bits of stuff in the air.  this makes me happy. ', '2008-05-21 10:16:51.000000', NULL, 0),
