(4719736, 676366, 68586, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your top ten finish.<br/> <br/>I''m not sure many people appreciate how hard it is to get a dog this crisp - especially when it is running at you and in mid stride . . <br/> <br/>I have taken (literally) countless shots of my dog running and got very few that are worthwhile. <br/> <br/>This on the otherhand looks spot on  :- )</td>', 'Congrats on your top ten finish. I''m not sure many people appreciate how hard it is to get a dog this crisp - especially when it is running at you and in mid stride . .  I have taken (literally) countless shots of my dog running and got very few that are worthwhile.  This on the otherhand looks spot on  :- )', '2008-05-23 13:01:10.000000', NULL, 0),
