(4722977, 677942, 66494, '<td valign="top">Actually having three rings is perfect compositionally. A rule of thumb graphically is go for the threes. <br/>Beautiful, serene, shot. Very well done. <br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tonyv:</b></div><hr/><i> This is a very busy image, and I am not sure where I am meant to look. A single set of rings may have been compositionally better. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Actually having three rings is perfect compositionally. A rule of thumb graphically is go for the threes. Beautiful, serene, shot. Very well done.  Originally posted by tonyv: This is a very busy image, and I am not sure where I am meant to look. A single set of rings may have been compositionally better. ', '2008-05-25 18:52:14.000000', NULL, 0),
