(4724672, 678015, 68035, '<td valign="top">Hey Lisa...I was one of your 9 - 9''s on this shot.  Its sometimes difficult to do something different with a subject that often appears on DPC but you have managed it here.  I love the lighting and the sharpness of the ''parachute'' seeds at the edge.  The green of the stalk is just so strong and beautiful<br/> <br/>Wonderful image, which has gone into my favourites<br/> <br/>Thank you for sharing this</td>', 'Hey Lisa...I was one of your 9 - 9''s on this shot.  Its sometimes difficult to do something different with a subject that often appears on DPC but you have managed it here.  I love the lighting and the sharpness of the ''parachute'' seeds at the edge.  The green of the stalk is just so strong and beautiful Wonderful image, which has gone into my favourites Thank you for sharing this', '2008-05-26 11:27:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4724699, 677919, 68035, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous reds on the flower heads and I love the muted reflection in the ''spilt'' water<br/> <br/>Very nice composition and application of the rule of thirds although I would have liked to see the top of the tulip on the right<br/> <br/>I love the capture of the petal edge</td>', 'Gorgeous reds on the flower heads and I love the muted reflection in the ''spilt'' water Very nice composition and application of the rule of thirds although I would have liked to see the top of the tulip on the right I love the capture of the petal edge', '2008-05-26 11:39:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4724720, 677983, 68035, '<td valign="top">6.18??? 6.18!!!!<br/> <br/>For goodness sake what does a person have to do to get a score that reflects the beauty of a picture on DPC nowadays<br/> <br/>This is an amazing capture, such beauty and delicacy<br/> <br/>I love the motion blur on the wings and the tail which is wonderful in comparision to the stillness of the head and beak<br/> <br/>As much as this bird brought you happiness on the day that you took your photo, looking at the image has probably given me more pleasure<br/> <br/>Wonderful</td>', '6.18??? 6.18!!!! For goodness sake what does a person have to do to get a score that reflects the beauty of a picture on DPC nowadays This is an amazing capture, such beauty and delicacy I love the motion blur on the wings and the tail which is wonderful in comparision to the stillness of the head and beak As much as this bird brought you happiness on the day that you took your photo, looking at the image has probably given me more pleasure Wonderful', '2008-05-26 11:45:45.000000', NULL, 0),
